    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "英語の百科事典の会社だってさ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They say it is an English encyclopedia company.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "最近はやってるみたいだな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Looks like that business is popular lately.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "課長、何かあったんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chief, did something happen?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "大ありだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Something huge happened.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "会社の売上金が全部金庫から消えたんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All the company sales money disappeared from the safe.'",
      "gap": 0.45
