      "t": "'Where is Ono-san?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "どこにもいないよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is nowhere to be found.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "会社は終わりだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The company is finished.'",
